window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"pantheon","b":"locke","win":["Pantheon","Pantheon","Pantheon","Pantheon","Pantheon","Pantheon","Pantheon"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 2","text":"Shield Vault into Comet Spear — near-lethal at 2"},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Starfall converts the lane lead into map pressure"},{"when":"1st item","text":"Your spike still beats Soul Ignition's self-burn window"}],"wants":{"you":["Combo all-ins on his mispositions","Aegis Assault faced at Ritual Nails","Roams funded by lane dominance"],"foe":["Somehow surviving your opener","Farming past your spear poke","Long fights where Silver Stake ramps"]},"early":"Play executioner: Comet Spear chips him at 1, and from 2 Shield Vault into Comet Spear takes most of his bar in one exchange. Ritual Nails marks you at 950 and he cashes the marks with autos, so face Aegis Assault at it — but it only covers your front, and Ashen Pursuit is a 10s dash that gets behind you.","mid":"Keep him suppressed through 4-5 — every wave costs a spear — but count Ashen Pursuit at a flat 10s: it resets his attack and is the wind-up before his burst. At 6 respect Purgatory, which grounds, and grounding shuts off Shield Vault and Grand Starfall together — your engage and your exit in one cast.","late":"Your opener still wins the short trade, but stop assuming the long one. Silver Stake is on-hit magic damage that grows with your missing health, so he accelerates as a fight turns, and Soul Ignition deals true damage whatever armour you bought. Purgatory grounds and executes. Open, then leave before the ramp.","whys":["Level 1 you out-poke him and threaten a fast all-in — throw Q on cooldown and look for the early lead.","Level 2 W-stun into Q nearly kills him outright — the two-spell combo is close to lethal on a squishy.","At 3 your full combo beats his trades, but Aegis Assault only covers the front and Ashen Pursuit gets behind it.","Levels 4-5 your kill pressure and poke keep him suppressed — he farms at spear-point.","Level 6 Grand Starfall adds dive and roam threat on top of a lane you already own.","First item your early spike sustains the lead over his burst — keep the pressure rolling.","Late your opener still wins the short trade, but Silver Stake ramps on your missing health and Purgatory grounds both dashes."]});
