window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"pantheon","b":"zaahen","win":["Skill","Pantheon","Pantheon","Skill","Skill","Pantheon","Pantheon"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 3","text":"Spear-vault combo out-bursts his pre-ramp kit"},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Starfall roams cash your lead elsewhere"},{"when":"1st item","text":"Lethality keeps the all-in lethal"}],"wants":{"you":["The level-3 kill window converted","Short full-combo trades only","Roams before his duel spike hardens"],"foe":["Extended trades his Glaive wins","Surviving your burst windows","Late slugfests as your burst falls off"]},"early":"The lane wakes up at 3 and it wakes up yours: Comet Spear into Shield Vault out-bursts him before Determination stacks. Levels 1-2, respect Aureate Rush (10s) — it is his only gap-closer, so step up once he has spent it. Bank the lead before the 4-5 stretch turns his.","mid":"From 4-5 his sustained damage beats your cooldown-bound burst, so trade like a mugger — full combo, then gone before Grim Deliverance (110s) heals him back. Buy Executioner's Calling: his Glaive and his ult both heal. At 6 take the roam — Starfall onto mid buys more than an even lane will.","late":"Your burst plateaus while he keeps scaling, so stop measuring yourself in slugfests you are built to lose. Stay the opener: W-stun picks, Aegis-covered engages and Starfall entrances still delete squishies and start fights better than he ever will — just let your team finish what your combo begins.","whys":["Level 1 is a neutral farm start — your combo is not online yet, so just trade last-hits.","Level 2 stays even — neither of you has a decisive trade until the full kits arrive.","At 3 your full Comet Spear plus Shield Vault combo out-bursts him before his ramp exists — this is your first kill window.","By 4-5 The Darkin Glaive (10s) heals him every trade and Aureate Rush chunks percent health — hit and leave, never stay.","Level 6 is even — your Grand Starfall roam threat balances against his growing duel strength.","At first item your lethality spike keeps the burst lethal — short trades and all-ins stay yours.","Late his passive revives him at full Determination, so burst alone stops closing — lean on picks, not slugfests."]});
