window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"pantheon","b":"masteryi","win":["Pantheon","Pantheon","Pantheon","Pantheon","Pantheon","Skill","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 2","text":"Stun-spear combo wins every trade"},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Burst all-in stays lethal to his squishy frame"},{"when":"1st item (his)","text":"A coin-flip — fight inside Alpha Strike's 20s gap"}],"wants":{"you":["Early zoning and jungle dives","Kills banked before his item spikes","Shield Vault onto every Meditate"],"foe":["Farm survival into two items","Alpha Strike out of your burst","Late duels your burst cannot answer"]},"early":"Front-run him: Comet Spear stings, Aegis Assault faced at him eats the counter-trade, and from 2 the stun-spear combo wins every exchange. Mortal Will only empowers your next spell — it blocks nothing, so the shield is the cooldown to hold. Zone him off CS and dive with your jungler; the clock is short.","mid":"Kill pressure holds through 6 — your burst is lethal to a squishy Yi. Two numbers run this stage. Meditate is a channel on a flat 10s that heals him, and Shield Vault is point-and-click, so the stun cancels it outright. Alpha Strike is 20s and he is untargetable during the dash — fight inside those 20 seconds.","late":"Two items deep, Highlander resets and Wuju Style true damage out-scale a burst that stopped growing, and armour does not answer true damage. Grievous Wounds is what makes Meditate survivable. Convert to the anti-Yi opener: Shield Vault him on entry, cancel the Meditate, let your carries erase him.","whys":["Comet Spear poke and a front-facing Aegis Assault shut down his weak early trades — he cannot start one profitably.","Comet Spear plus the W stun keeps every early trade yours — stun, stab, walk away.","Your frontloaded burst dominates the level-3 window — a full combo removes half his health.","Through 4-5 Aegis Assault and Shield Vault still beat him, and the stun cancels Meditate outright.","Your level-6 burst all-in with the stun stays lethal to a squishy Yi — keep hunting him.","His first item stabilizes the duel into a skill-based coin-flip — pick your fights with more care now.","Late Highlander resets and Wuju Style's true damage beat your fading burst — hand the 1v1 to someone else."]});
